- **Concern**: The plan initializes phase2_relaunch_count next to fallback_count after the grouped phase-2 loop, but the proposed increment runs in the reuse_slot_result fall-through inside that loop.. Scenario: Under set -u, a cp reuse failure executes arithmetic on an unset variable before reaching the initializer, so the dispatcher aborts instead of relaunching and emitting the warning KVs.
